  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a key player in the achievement of three of the NCCS pillars within the financial sector, the Ministry of Finance (MOF) aspire to introduce environment-sensitive management of public finance practices, macro-economic sustainability and financial resilience initiatives. Consequently, the overall objective of this program is to support MOF&#x2019;s aim to systematically mainstream resilience (including climate resilience) and macro-fiscal sustainability into the government&#x2019;s budgeting and decision-mak</narrative>
  </description>
